    <li><strong>Read the resulting cosecant ratio.</strong> It is a dimensionless number describing the hypotenuse as a multiple of the opposite side.</li>
    <li><strong>Verify that the answer is greater than 1.</strong> Anything at or below 1 signals an input error.</li>
