  </ol>
  <p>Notice what the calculator never asks for: no angle <span set:html={rich('[[A]]')} /> in degrees, no adjacent side, and no sine value. Two side lengths are the complete input because the ratio <span set:html={rich('[[c/a]]')} /> depends on nothing else.</p>
