  <p>Verify: <span set:html={rich('[[\\sin(30^\\circ)=0.5]]')} />, and <span set:html={rich('[[1/0.5=2]]')} />. This exact value is worth memorizing because the 30-60-90 triangle appears constantly in geometry problems.</p>

